<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-14T14:22:18.977Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:22:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Trump, Xi and Putin are meeting in China while US envoys say Europe will join any Ukraine peace talks after recent talks with Putin. Russia sent a major business delegation to Kabul for talks with the Taliban, linking its diplomatic outreach to the war. A car bomb in Russia killed a military officer and wounded a former adviser to Ukraine’s ex-pro-Russia prime minister. A cyberattack struck a German drone manufacturer that supplies Ukraine. The conflict caused 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwvg2l312ylqo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20261114-china-to-host-first-ever-trilateral-meeting-between-trump-xi-and-putin-next-week-us-says&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/world/europe/russia-ukraine-witkoff-kushner.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/russia-sends-major-business-delegation-to-kabul-for-business-talks-with-the-taliban&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/azerbaijan-intensifies-its-european-engagement-at-the-epc-summit&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/12/after-meeting-putin-us-envoys-say-europe-join-talks-ending-ukraine-war/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/14/trump-xi-putin-trilateral-meeting-at-apec-what-to-expect?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQMXlzLUQtSFlMUmxtemZJTk13emUzT2stSmpjb1M1UC1oUS0wRFhtOVVSOUJ2TE5NNTVzVmQtc2VIN25GZ3k5dTJNTmJidDRoUnFaVHZtdFljXzB5aFY4R2pvbk1kN05Kb